          "page": 4,
          "section": "3.4. Deformation behavior under 10 % compression",
          "quote": "Consequently, we classify these ≈ 3 ◦ features as incipient kink band precursors — defined as discrete, small-angle block rotations driven by localized dislocation pile-ups, which serve as the nuclei for the fully developed kink bands observed at higher strains",
